WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:04.170
- In one episode--

00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:06.639
you're going to shake your
head-- your daughter--

00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:08.508
GLORIA ESTEFAN: Yes.

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:12.945
- In effect calls you out
about the fact that she is gay

00:00:12.978 --> 00:00:15.982
and she says that you were
reluctant to let her tell

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:20.420
her grandmother that she had
come out before her grandmother

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:21.321
passed away.

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:23.189 line:0%
GLORIA ESTEFAN: In
the Latin community,

00:00:23.222 --> 00:00:25.892 line:0%
a lot of these subjects
aren't touched.

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:27.460 line:0%
They're taboo.

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:29.562 line:0%
People see but they don't
want to talk about it.

00:00:29.595 --> 00:00:30.796
They don't want to see it.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.399
I have all these people that
have loved me through the years

00:00:33.432 --> 00:00:36.302
and supported, and I want
them to realize that we're

00:00:36.335 --> 00:00:39.939
all just families, trying to get
through the difficult moments

00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:41.173
in life.

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:45.411
Emily, I thought, would feel
comfortable coming out to me.

00:00:45.444 --> 00:00:49.348
We've been very, very
open about the support

00:00:49.381 --> 00:00:52.285
for the LGBT community
our entire lives.

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:55.121
And at the same time I had a
mother with ulcerative colitis

00:00:55.154 --> 00:00:58.791
that, even if I brought up
a bill or something that

00:00:58.824 --> 00:01:01.894
was not even important,
would get very upset

00:01:01.927 --> 00:01:02.695
and would get sick.

00:01:02.728 --> 00:01:04.797
So, yeah, and life
is complicated.

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:05.898
Life is tough.

00:01:05.931 --> 00:01:08.868
And we wanted to share
those things with people

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:12.972
so they would realize these are
conversations we need to have.

00:01:13.005 --> 00:01:17.877
And it really was
wonderful, the response.

